    "As we talk, useful words and phrases find a home here. Their strength grows when you recall them over time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As we talk, useful words and phrases find a home here. Their strength grows when you recall them over time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras hablamos, las palabras y frases útiles encuentran aquí su sitio. Su fuerza crece cuando las recuerdas con el tiempo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En discutant, les mots et expressions utiles trouvent ici leur place. Leur force grandit quand tu les rappelles au fil du temps."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Während wir reden, finden nützliche Wörter und Formulierungen hier ein Zuhause. Ihre Kraft wächst, wenn du sie mit der Zeit abrufst."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mentre parliamo, parole e frasi utili trovano casa qui. La loro forza cresce quando le richiami nel tempo."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conforme conversamos, palavras e frases úteis encontram um lar aqui. A força delas cresce quando você as lembra com o tempo."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etter hvert som vi snakker, finner nyttige ord og uttrykk et hjem her. De blir sterkere når du husker dem over tid."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们聊天时，有用的词语和短语会安家在这里。随着时间推移反复回忆，它们会越来越牢固。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio and selected text go to OpenAI while you practise. Requests disable provider storage where supported; abuse-monitoring retention may still apply. Raw audio is not saved by Palique.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio and selected text go to OpenAI while you practise. Requests disable provider storage where supported; abuse-monitoring retention may still apply. Raw audio is not saved by Palique."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mientras practicas, el audio y el texto seleccionado van a OpenAI. Las peticiones desactivan el almacenamiento del proveedor donde está soportado; la retención para monitorizar abusos puede seguir aplicando. Palique no guarda el audio en bruto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'audio et le texte sélectionné sont envoyés à OpenAI pendant ton entraînement. Les requêtes désactivent le stockage du fournisseur quand c'est pris en charge ; la conservation pour la surveillance des abus peut continuer de s'appliquer. Palique n'enregistre pas l'audio brut."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio und ausgewählter Text gehen an OpenAI, während du übst. Anfragen deaktivieren, wo unterstützt, die Speicherung durch den Anbieter; die Aufbewahrung zur Missbrauchsüberwachung kann trotzdem gelten. Rohaudio speichert Palique nicht."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio e testo selezionato vanno a OpenAI mentre ti alleni. Le richieste disattivano l'archiviazione del fornitore dove supportato; la conservazione per il monitoraggio degli abusi può comunque applicarsi. Palique non salva l'audio grezzo."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O áudio e o texto selecionado vão para a OpenAI enquanto você pratica. As requisições desativam o armazenamento do provedor quando compatível; a retenção para monitoramento de abuso ainda pode se aplicar. O Palique não salva o áudio bruto."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lyd og valgt tekst sendes til OpenAI mens du øver. Forespørsler slår av leverandørlagring der det støttes; oppbevaring til misbruksovervåking kan fortsatt gjelde. Rå lyd lagres ikke av Palique."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "练习时，音频和选定的文本会发送给 OpenAI。在受支持的范围内，请求会禁用服务商的存储；滥用监测的留存可能仍然适用。Palique 不会保存原始音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio is already in use. Finish the current audio activity and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio is already in use. Finish the current audio activity and try again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El audio ya está en uso. Termina la actividad de audio actual e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'audio est déjà utilisé. Termine l'activité audio en cours et réessaie."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Ton wird bereits verwendet. Beende die aktuelle Audio-Aktivität und versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'audio è già in uso. Concludi l'attività audio in corso e riprova."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O áudio já está em uso. Encerre a atividade de áudio atual e tente novamente."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lyden er allerede i bruk. Avslutt den pågående lydaktiviteten og prøv igjen."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音频正被占用。请先结束当前的音频活动，再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio is already in use. Please finish the current audio activity and try again.": {
