    "With your permission, Palique sends audio and selected text to OpenAI to provide conversations and meanings. Provider retention rules apply.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your permission, Palique sends audio and selected text to OpenAI to provide conversations and meanings. Provider retention rules apply."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con tu permiso, Palique envía audio y texto seleccionado a OpenAI para ofrecer conversaciones y significados. Se aplican las reglas de retención del proveedor."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec ta permission, Palique envoie l'audio et le texte sélectionné à OpenAI pour fournir conversations et sens. Les règles de conservation du fournisseur s'appliquent."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit deiner Erlaubnis sendet Palique Audio und ausgewählten Text an OpenAI, um Gespräche und Bedeutungen bereitzustellen. Die Aufbewahrungsregeln des Anbieters gelten."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con il tuo permesso, Palique invia audio e testo selezionato a OpenAI per fornire conversazioni e significati. Si applicano le regole di conservazione del fornitore."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Com sua permissão, o Palique envia áudio e texto selecionado para a OpenAI para oferecer conversas e significados. As regras de retenção do provedor se aplicam."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Med tillatelsen din sender Palique lyd og valgt tekst til OpenAI for å gi samtaler og betydninger. Leverandørens oppbevaringsregler gjelder."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经你同意后，Palique 会将音频和选定的文本发送给 OpenAI，以提供对话和含义。服务商的留存规则同样适用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
